msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid "Oh, that would be my son."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid "I sent him off to Kyushu to learn how to make ramen the old-fashioned way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1232"
msgid "I'm going to mind the place while he's gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1244"
msgid "So that's where he went."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1256"
msgid ""
"Kyushu No. 1 Star is famous for its authentic tonkotsu soup. That's why "
"we're called Kyushu No. 1 Star."
msgstr ""

